<title>USA: Boyd Gaming names Snyder president.</title>
<headline>Boyd Gaming names Snyder president.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boyd Gaming Corp said its board named Donald Snyder president of the company effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Snyder, presently executive vice president, chief administrative officer and a member of its board of directors, will succeed Charles Ruthe who has held the post since 1988 and is retiring at the end of 1996.</p>
</text>
